{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_ncdeer_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ncdeer_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"大慈恻隐","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ncdeer_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"3b85df0bcc6837568aff86cdf0e007a6da7a4ad0b142297344c405d1ef2b1927","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"求求您，求求您！行行好，您就答应我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能治好那富商的孩子，就能拿到一大笔赏金，求您了医生，我、我给您干活，您要我干什么，绝无二话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我的妻子给我写了信，她和孩子待的城镇要来天灾，他们错过了时间，没办法出来了。但要是在那里待着，我实在不放心......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道是我贪心了，您救过我，我原不该再求您什么，您不乐意下山，我都知道，但我实在是没有办法了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我一拿到这笔钱，就去找人带我妻儿出来，绝不做他用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"您就帮我这一回，您就是救了我的命了！我对天起誓！如果说出去，我满身生癞，不得好死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的药有用，她的药有用！谢谢恩人，谢谢恩人啊！我对天起誓！您的恩情，我来日必报，若违誓言，我满身生癞，不得好死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜呜娘......您吃这个，您有救了，呜呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"药不够了？没事，九色鹿医生在的，没事的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"通讯断了好几天了，还有什么方法能联络到外面吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么越来越多的人死了，怎么回事？不是说九色鹿都能救的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那个女人不太对劲啊，她从哪里来的，她救我们......怎么不收钱？她是不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个女人就是为了宣传自己的药，博取大家的信任才留在这的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看她的源石技艺，是她带来的天灾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"带来灾祸的埃拉菲亚，滚出去！滚出去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为我救他们，他们就会信任我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我治疗他们，爱着他们，我们就能和平相处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是这样的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"医生......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不愿与山下人再有纠葛，你不该来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧。别再来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，是、是我痴心妄想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了，我自己去想办法......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"这么晚了，您还是来啦。我就猜到您会来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个富商的孩子，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"那孩子现在就在诊所，病得奇怪，一日一日衰弱下去。饭倒还能吃一些，只是嗜睡得厉害，天天喊着脖子痛，连烧了好几天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"她父亲急得不得了，四处打听到咱们这里有位能妙手回春的医生，告示贴得人尽皆知，我想着您肯定要下来问问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人罹病，我怎么会见死不救呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，今早有个人找来我住的地方了，这几日我会换个地方住着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"是您救过的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"总是有这样的人......您都说了不要来找，为什么就是不听呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无事，我以后会多加注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您还在这里我就很高兴啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，子书。带我去看看那孩子吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......痛......痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这孩子的病......不寻常啊。这回不是我拿点草药来你们就能治好的情况了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子书，这回我会在山下住两日，除了患者，谁都不见，就拜托你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"知道啦，有我盯着，不会让人随意进来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有件事要托你明日和那富商说一说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这回人们会怎么想我？冷酷无情的......埃拉菲亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两钱、半钱、三钱，这些草药，制成药丸......连服八天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好苦，好苦......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，别担心，你喜欢什么味的？花花，还是茶叶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喜欢花花......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你看——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在闻闻看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......甜甜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃吧，吃吧，吃了药，香香甜甜的，就不痛啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，这个......为什么是甜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为有你这样的小哭包呀，小哭包为了不吃药哭鼻子，甜甜的你是不是就愿意吃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等吃完了，姐姐给你做蜜糖吃好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿医生，这么晚了，您该休息了！三天没合眼了，熬坏了自己的身子，对谁都没好处啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我要把这本看完，这本很重要，看完就吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的饭刚才我已经让您吃过了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊......那就看完就睡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"现在就去睡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王二！还在外面晃悠哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"没事少来烦我，忙着呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，钱还没够？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咱们没手艺的就是难啊，我那日听富商手下说自家小姐被一个可厉害的医生救了，富商家的小姐哪！那医生应该是能拿不少钱啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......被可厉害的医生救了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也抓紧点，都过去几天了，要想安全，还是得尽早把你家人都接回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，她不是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"医生不是这样的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我今晚一定要去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这味药......不行，这个也不行，都是不能同服，之前的笔记上记了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小瓷身子也虚，之前喂的药还是猛了些，剂量还需要再斟酌一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这味药副作用太大，小瓷受不住，下次不可再加......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这味药小瓷有些过敏，也不能用，还需要再换......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不够，我的知识还是不够，还要看更多的书才行，还要再尝试才行。小瓷的身体撑不了太久，没有时间了，我要抓紧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他们采药回来了，这些都是您早上说要的......您头发怎么乱成这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......这里，你看这里，这个药方它——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"您说，我给您拢拢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个药性相冲不好放在一起，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......啊，我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我上山一趟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"——你头发就乱着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"大晚上的......您真的要现在就去吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走快些，天亮之前应该能回去，这一剂方成了，小瓷的病就能好得快些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这个毒草，长得好像野菜，要记下来存着，别被这里的人采去误食了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前给没长成的药草都分别做了记号，看来还是不行，以后再遇到没长成的，还是移到院子里去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望没有被虫食掉......不乱想了，先上山吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天亮起来了，这回怎么找了这么久都没看到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......在这里有吗？之前留的记号，几日没来加固，好像分辨不清了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！这毒草，没有注意就......回去再处理吧。只是这里再往上的话，就不是药草的生长环境了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“其色若雪，味清苦，多见于岩缝中，或生于悬崖之上。”悬崖之上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好累，现在攀崖的话......不行，小瓷等不及了，必须尽快拿回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书上说绳结应该这样打，没想到在这里也用上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望不会出事吧，嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......医生，在替那孩子治病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说不愿下山？不是......不是拒绝了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"烧已经退了，晨起也吃了药粥，没有吐，晚饭时候看脖子肿块消下去了一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿姐姐，你头发的颜色为什么和我们不一样呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你看看这里，这个花纹呢，漂亮吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！爹爹说过，姐姐是大好人，所以姐姐头发才会这么漂亮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我爹爹也是好人，为什么你不相信他呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不相信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"子书姐姐不让爹爹说是姐姐救了我，也不让我以后说是姐姐救了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小瓷，我救你们，也救大家，这样就很好了，不用再多说什么，也不用再多做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这几日，爹爹都去哪了?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐有件事拜托你爹爹，过几日他就能回来了，到时候小瓷要健健康康地见爹爹，好吗?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，今天说了太多的话了，不早了，先躺下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那今天给你讲的故事，是很久很久以前，在山林里，有一个......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"narration","text":"两日后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——多久都没出来伸懒腰了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"您最近翻的医书快把外屋堆满了，好好歇歇眼睛吧。今天阳光不错，也暖和，我待会儿把小瓷的被褥也拿出来晒晒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小瓷病渐渐好起来了，您心里也是开心的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，过会儿我也要再看看需不需要换几味药。拿把躺椅，叫小瓷也出来透透气吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我去烹点茶，您要喝什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都可，你烹的都很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一杯加点糖！小瓷还是爱喝甜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加了糖的茶不是茶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"子书姐姐，我想喝甜的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......万里无云，好天气呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小瓷，你最近说喜欢的那个句子，是什么来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"“小晴日，和絮飞飞，点点瓷轻绘。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"里面有我的名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把被角掖好，别让风吹到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"谁啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开门，开门！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在敲门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人吗！有人吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生，你在吧！我知道你在这，我亲眼看见你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的、真的在给富商的女儿治病，是不是？！我以为你不要钱财，以为你清清白白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我信了你，结果呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哪个医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凑热闹的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......他这说的什么胡话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生了什么事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生，你在里头，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"城镇那边说人都疏散完了，但是我妻儿现在和我断了联络不知道多少天了，他们现在都不知道在哪！天灾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我筹不到钱，救不了妻儿，是我自己没用，我不怨别人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我想问你，我们这群人在你眼里，是不是就是傻子？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道你骗我，就是想要那些钱？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想要钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凑热闹的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有这种事？也太过分了，不帮就算了，怎么还骗人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凑热闹的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是哪位医生啊，这么坏，我以后都不敢来看病了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给个说法！给个说法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就知道会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我以为我救他们，他们就会信任我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我治疗他们，爱着他们，我们就能和平相处。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是这样的吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你胡说！姐姐没有收我们的钱！咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你别跑，别跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事......我不能让人欺负姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些坏人！你们怎么能这样想......姐姐她，她，不是那样的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小瓷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，小瓷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去与他说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"你终于出来了，医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"门开了门开了......是哪个医生啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到医生了——啊，怎么是九色鹿医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凑热闹的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？说的是那个九色鹿医生？这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是个混账，你们也是群混账，这是九色鹿医生啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我被石头砸了都以为完了，家里后事都准备上了，九色鹿医生救了我，我才捡了条命回来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凑热闹的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦——就是这个医生啊！我，那现在这是，该信谁啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又犯浑了！我、我、九色鹿医生不叫我说来着，但我不是偷偷和你们说过吗！医生没收我钱，一分都没收，还送了我一堆草药！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，是我！您还记得我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家伙都听到没？我说的可全都是真的，九色鹿医生肯定不是那样的人！什么贪财，这不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿医生，不管别人说什么，您救过我，我信您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小瓷，爹爹回来了！你怎么在这站着，这里怎么这么多人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"爹爹，你回来了！有坏人要欺负医生姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"他说姐姐骗了他，还不帮忙救他的妻儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妻儿？是城镇里那两个人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿医生不收我的钱，只叫我帮忙，走我行商的路接了两个人回来。现在人就安排在客栈里，这是怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"走行商的路从城镇里接人......难道说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我本不想让你知道是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不愿再与人有过多纠葛，这不是骗你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的？我的家人，没事......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若说的是我接回的妇人与孩子，我可以担保，他们安然无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"是医生，是医生帮了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"......就是医生帮了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"而我却怀疑医生，我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我都做了什么啊......我实在是太混账了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"您这样帮我，我、我没脸见您了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨，也是我，没有说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿医生，小女的病真的劳您费心了，今天还遇到了这种事，也都怪我救女心切给您闹了这么多麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在外面也认识不少人的，这回我算是欠您一个大人情了，如今这样，不如我荐您去外面的大医馆就职如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，别走啊，我、我要给您赔罪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就挺好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"narration","text":"多日后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿医生，小女的病如今已大好了，这是在下托人搜集来的各类医术典籍，小小谢意，请您笑纳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生病小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"九色鹿姐姐，子书姐姐，我来啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小瓷，规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，病了这么久，看着她活泼点也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我以为我救他们，他们就会信任我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太感谢您了......唉，上山一不留神，就被那毒草给刺了，本来以为洗洗就好了，哪想到肿成这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诊所医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"还说呢，再晚点你这就走不了路了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢九色鹿医生啊......我们村子里有您，真的实在是，太好了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必言谢，以后自己小心着就是。这些草药丸你拿些，再被寻常毒草划了，可以吃些解毒。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我治疗他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......前几日山崖上看到的药草，我的记号是在这里吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不错，没有被虫食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秋日快到了，这些药草都存些种子，以后自己种来试试看，应该会方便许多。"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱着他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玩闹的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，九色鹿姐姐被我抓住啦，我赢啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玩闹的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也要，我也要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玩闹的小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，这个香丸是我的，我赢了才有的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要吵，每个人最后都会有的，明天我们继续玩，好不好？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我们就能和平相处，是这样的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"多年未见，这一画，可解你心结？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凡有所见，皆是虚妄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，现在如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年不见，我也该回去瞧瞧子书了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九色鹿","speakerId":"avg_4019_ncdeer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这几味草药，我还要给一个地方送去，算算日子......他们应该在这附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"你还给自己找了个事做？有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是兴致尽了，哪也不愿去......等这山开满了花，我再来找你，同饮一杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2015_dusk","aliases":["夕"]}]}
